    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a controller, call your friends, and get ready to yell. <i>KamiKaze</i> is a couch-fueled, chaos-blasted, 4-player local multiplayer shooter where every round is a new story of betrayal, laughter, and explosive comebacks. With only 3 minutes on the clock, anything can happen\u2014and usually does.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What Is KamiKaze?</strong> It\u2019s a neon-soaked free-for-all brawler where you spawn with a Rifle, a Pistol, and your trusty Katana\u2014and then the mayhem begins. Use quick reflexes, grab unpredictable powerups, and make every second count as you blast, slice, and bounce your friends off the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Game Modes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Deathmatch</strong>Welcome to the main event. Everyone vs everyone. No mercy.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Win Condition</strong>: Most kills in 3 minutes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Health Madness</strong>: Every kill drops a health pack. Oh, and every 60 seconds your health gets swapped with someone else. Good luck!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerups Include</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Golden Gun</i>: One shot. One kill. No pressure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Anti-Gravity Gun</i>: Send your enemies soaring.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Paintball Gun</i>: Splatter them with chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Giant Gun</i>: Get hit and you turn into a giant. Yes, really.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udea9 <strong>Capture the Flag</strong> One flag. Random spawn. Pure chaos.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How It Works</strong>: A single flag spawns randomly. Kill the flag bearer to claim it. Hold it when the clock hits 0 and you win.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Limits</strong>: Bring whatever weapons and powerups you can find. Fair play? Nah.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategize or Sabotage</strong>: Camp the flag? Rush in headfirst? Or let your \u201cfriends\u201d fight while you swoop in at the last second?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Maps &amp; Mayhem:</strong> From neon-lit rooftops to tightly-packed city streets, each arena is built for one thing: maximum chaos in minimum time. Every map is designed for fast movement, sneaky ambushes, and unforgettable moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why You\u2019ll Rage-Laugh With KamiKaze:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 Perfect for parties, roommates, or rivals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca3 3-minute rounds = nonstop action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf Pure skill? Pure luck? Who cares\u2014it's FUN.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd2f Powerups that flip the script every match.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're hunting for glory, revenge, or just hilarious highlight clips, <i>KamiKaze</i> delivers ridiculous fun, punchy gameplay, and the kind of couch co-op chaos that ruins friendships\u2014in the best way possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the screaming begin. \ud83d\udc4a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688610/extras/6662391f7a9f5e0a3fb0ea6e405adde8.avif?t=1754589565\" width=800 height=424 /></span><br><br></p>",
