    "short_description": "KamiKaZe is a controller-only multiplayer shooter where it's every player for themselves\u2014no teams, just pure free-for-all action! Each player needs their own controller: whether it\u2019s a 1v1, a three-player showdown, or a full four-player brawl.Grab your controllers and prove who\u2019s the best!",
